<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Harlem Renaissance — Interactive Cultural Archive</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Fraunces (Modern Editorial Serif) & Plus Jakarta Sans (Clean Geometric Sans) -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        cream: '#FAF8F6',
                        pure: '#FFFFFF',
                        brown: {
                            DEFAULT: '#3E2723',
                            light: '#5D4037',
                            muted: '#795548',
                            border: '#E8DFDA'
                        },
                        crimson: {
                            DEFAULT: '#C62828',
                            hover: '#B71C1C',
                            soft: '#FFEBEE'
                        },
                        gold: {
                            DEFAULT: '#F9A825',
                            bright: '#FBC02D',
                            soft: '#FFF9C4'
                        },
                        blush: {
                            DEFAULT: '#FCE4EC',
                            medium: '#F8BBD0',
                            deep: '#F48FB1'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        serif: ['Fraunces', 'Georgia', 'serif'],
                        sans: ['Plus Jakarta Sans', '-apple-system', 'BlinkMacSystemFont', 'sans-serif'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        /* Minimalist Custom Scrollbar & Smooth Transitions */
        body {
            background-color: #FAF8F6;
            color: #3E2723;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        
        .editorial-title {
            font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        /* Subtle card hover elevation */
        .figure-card {
            transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), border-color 0.25s ease;
        }
        .figure-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -8px rgba(62, 39, 35, 0.08);
            border-color: #F8BBD0;
        }

        /* Modal backdrop transition */
        .modal-backdrop {
            transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
        }
        .modal-panel {
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), opacity 0.25s ease;
        }

        /* Custom thin scrollbar inside modal */
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #FAF8F6;
        }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #D7CCC8;
            border-radius: 9999px;
        }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #3E2723;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-blush-medium selection:text-brown">

    <!-- Minimalist Sticky Navigation -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 bg-pure/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brown-border">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between py-4 gap-3">
                <!-- Brand / Title -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-crimson"></span>
                    <span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-gold-bright -ml-1.5"></span>
                    <span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blush-medium -ml-1.5"></span>
                    <button onclick="switchTab('figures')" class="text-left focus:outline-none">
                        <span class="editorial-title font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-brown tracking-tight">Harlem Renaissance</span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- View Switcher Pills -->
                <nav class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-cream p-1 rounded-full border border-brown-border self-start sm:self-auto" aria-label="Primary Navigation">
                    <button id="nav-figures" onclick="switchTab('figures')" class="nav-pill px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-brown text-pure shadow-sm">
                        Notable Figures
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-overview" onclick="switchTab('overview')" class="nav-pill px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all text-brown hover:bg-blush/60">
                        Historical Overview
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-quiz" onclick="switchTab('quiz')" class="nav-pill px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all text-brown hover:bg-blush/60">
                        Knowledge Quiz
                    </button>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Editorial Hero Banner -->
    <section class="bg-pure border-b border-brown-border">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14">
            <div class="max-w-3xl">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blush text-brown text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-crimson"></span>
                    1918 – 1937 • New York City
                </div>
                <h1 class="editorial-title text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-brown leading-tight mb-4">
                    Voices, Art &amp; Legacy of the <span class="text-crimson underline decoration-gold-bright decoration-4 underline-offset-4">New Negro Movement</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-brown-light text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                    Explore the intellectual, social, and artistic explosion centered in Harlem, Manhattan. Discover the groundbreaking works and intimate personal stories of the visionaries who reshaped American culture.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT CONTAINER -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">

        <!-- ========================================================= -->
        <!-- VIEW 1: NOTABLE FIGURES DIRECTORY                         -->
        <!-- ========================================================= -->
        <section id="view-figures" class="space-y-8">
            <!-- Controls: Search & Discipline Filter -->
            <div class="bg-pure p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border border-brown-border shadow-sm space-y-4">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                    <!-- Category Pills -->
                    <div id="category-filters" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <button data-cat="All" class="cat-btn active px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold bg-crimson text-pure transition-colors">
                            All Figures (12)
                        </button>
                        <button data-cat="Literature & Poetry" class="cat-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium bg-cream text-brown hover:bg-blush transition-colors">
                            Literature &amp; Poetry
                        </button>
                        <button data-cat="Music & Jazz" class="cat-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium bg-cream text-brown hover:bg-blush transition-colors">
                            Music &amp; Jazz
                        </button>
                        <button data-cat="Visual Arts" class="cat-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium bg-cream text-brown hover:bg-blush transition-colors">
                            Visual Arts
                        </button>
                        <button data-cat="Stage & Screen" class="cat-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium bg-cream text-brown hover:bg-blush transition-colors">
                            Stage &amp; Screen
                        </button>
                        <button data-cat="Thinkers & Activists" class="cat-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium bg-cream text-brown hover:bg-blush transition-colors">
                            Thinkers &amp; Activists
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Search Input -->
                    <div class="relative w-full md:w-64 shrink-0">
                        <input 
                            type="text" 
                            id="search-input" 
                            placeholder="Search name, work, or life..." 
                            class="w-full pl-9 pr-4 py-2 bg-cream border border-brown-border rounded-full text-sm text-brown placeholder-brown-muted focus:outline-none focus:border-crimson focus:bg-pure transition-colors"
                        >
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brown-muted absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Results Count Info -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm text-brown-muted px-1">
                <p id="results-counter">Showing 12 iconic figures — click any card to read their history &amp; personal life</p>
                <button id="reset-filters-btn" onclick="resetFilters()" class="hidden text-crimson font-semibold hover:underline">Reset filters</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Figures Grid -->
            <div id="figures-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- Populated dynamically via JavaScript -->
            </div>

            <!-- Empty State -->
            <div id="empty-state" class="hidden text-center py-16 bg-pure rounded-2xl border border-brown-border">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blush text-crimson mx-auto flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.172 16.172a4 4 0 015.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="editorial-title text-lg font-bold text-brown mb-1">No matching figures found</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-brown-muted mb-4">Try adjusting your search keyword or selecting another category.</p>
                <button onclick="resetFilters()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-brown text-pure text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-crimson transition-colors">
                    Show All Figures
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ========================================================= -->
        <!-- VIEW 2: HISTORICAL OVERVIEW & TIMELINE                    -->
        <!-- ========================================================= -->
        <section id="view-overview" class="hidden space-y-10">
            <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-pure p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl border border-brown-border">
                    <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gold-soft text-brown text-xs font-bold mb-4">01 • Catalyst</span>
                    <h2 class="editorial-title text-xl font-bold text-brown mb-2">The Great Migration</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-brown-light leading-relaxed">
                        Between 1916 and 1940, over 1.5 million African Americans relocated from the rural, Jim Crow South to northern industrial cities. Harlem became the premier destination, transforming into a vibrant Black metropolis of intellectuals, artists, and working-class dreamers.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-pure p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl border border-brown-border">
                    <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blush text-crimson text-xs font-bold mb-4">02 • Philosophy</span>
                    <h2 class="editorial-title text-xl font-bold text-brown mb-2">The "New Negro"</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-brown-light leading-relaxed">
                        Coined and popularized by philosopher Alain Locke in 1925, the "New Negro" rejected old racial caricatures. It championed self-determination, racial pride, modern artistic expression, and an unapologetic celebration of African heritage and everyday Black life.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-pure p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl border border-brown-border">
                    <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-crimson-soft text-crimson text-xs font-bold mb-4">03 • Lasting Legacy</span>
                    <h2 class="editorial-title text-xl font-bold text-brown mb-2">Global Cultural Shift</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-brown-light leading-relaxed">
                        Though the Great Depression slowed patronage in the 1930s, the movement permanently redefined American literature, jazz, visual art, and theater—laying the cultural and intellectual groundwork for the Civil Rights Movement of the 1950s and 1960s.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Minimalist Timeline -->
            <div class="bg-pure p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-brown-border">
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-crimson">Chronology</span>
                    <h2 class="editorial-title text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-brown mt-1">Key Milestones of the Era</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="relative border-l-2 border-gold-bright ml-3 sm:ml-4 space-y-8 pl-6 sm:pl-8">
                    <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-crimson border-2 border-pure absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5"></span>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-cream border border-brown-border text-xs font-bold text-brown mb-1">1919</span>
                        <h3 class="editorial-title text-lg font-bold text-brown">The 369th Infantry "Harlem Hellfighters" Return</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-brown-light mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                            Following heroic service in World War I, the all-Black 369th Infantry Regiment marches up Fifth Avenue into Harlem, sparking immense racial pride and introducing European audiences to James Reese Europe's jazz band.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-gold-bright border-2 border-pure absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5"></span>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-cream border border-brown-border text-xs font-bold text-brown mb-1">1921</span>
                        <h3 class="editorial-title text-lg font-bold text-brown"><em>Shuffle Along</em> Triumphs on Broadway</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-brown-light mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                            Written, produced, and performed by African Americans (including Eubie Blake, Noble Sissle, and a young Josephine Baker), this hit musical proves Black theater can command mainstream Broadway audiences.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Timeline Item 3 -->
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-crimson border-2 border-pure absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5"></span>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-cream border border-brown-border text-xs font-bold text-brown mb-1">1925</span>
                        <h3 class="editorial-title text-lg font-bold text-brown">Publication of <em>The New Negro</em> Anthology</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-brown-light mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                            Edited by Alain Locke and illustrated by Aaron Douglas, this landmark anthology brings together poetry, fiction, and essays by Langston Hughes, Zora Neale Hurston, Claude McKay, and W.E.B. Du Bois.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Timeline Item 4 -->
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-gold-bright border-2 border-pure absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5"></span>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-cream border border-brown-border text-xs font-bold text-brown mb-1">1926</span>
                        <h3 class="editorial-title text-lg font-bold text-brown"><em>Fire!!</em> Magazine &amp; "The Negro Artist and the Racial Mountain"</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-brown-light mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                            Younger artists including Hughes, Hurston, and Wallace Thurman publish the bold avant-garde journal <em>Fire!!</em>, declaring artistic independence from both white expectations and Black middle-class respectability politics.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Timeline Item 5 -->
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-crimson border-2 border-pure absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5"></span>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-cream border border-brown-border text-xs font-bold text-brown mb-1">1937</span>
                        <h3 class="editorial-title text-lg font-bold text-brown"><em>Their Eyes Were Watching God</em> Published</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-brown-light mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                            Zora Neale Hurston publishes her masterpiece novel, capturing the richness of Southern Black vernacular and womanhood—a crowning literary achievement as the era transitions toward the social realism of the late 1930s.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ========================================================= -->
        <!-- VIEW 3: INTERACTIVE KNOWLEDGE QUIZ                        -->
        <!-- ========================================================= -->
        <section id="view-quiz" class="hidden max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <div class="bg-pure p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-brown-border shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-brown-border pb-4 mb-6">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-crimson">Interactive Check</span>
                        <h2 class="editorial-title text-2xl font-bold text-brown">History &amp; Personal Lives Quiz</h2>
                    </div>
                    <span id="quiz-progress-badge" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blush text-brown text-xs font-bold">
                        Question 1 of 5
                    </span>
                </div>

                <!-- Active Quiz Body -->
                <div id="quiz-active-area" class="space-y-6">
                    <h3 id="quiz-question-text" class="editorial-title text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-brown leading-snug">
                        <!-- Question injected here -->
                    </h3>

                    <div id="quiz-options-container" class="space-y-3">
                        <!-- Options injected here -->
                    </div>

                    <!-- Explanation Feedback Box -->
                    <div id="quiz-feedback-box" class="hidden p-4 rounded-xl bg-cream border border-brown-border text-sm text-brown-light leading-relaxed">
